sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Candidate
    participant A as AI Agent
    participant P as OJCP Provider
    participant V as Identity Verifier<br/>(ID.me / Clear)

    Note over P,V: Session Initiation
    A->>P: begin_application(job_id, agent_declaration)
    P->>V: POST verification_endpoint<br/>(provider_id, nonce, callback_url)
    V-->>P: session_id + verification_url
    P-->>A: status: pending_verification<br/>+ verification_steps[proof_delivery: provider_managed]

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over C,V: Human Verification (embedded in apply form)
        A-->>C: Present apply form with embedded verification
        C->>V: Face scan / ID upload
        V-->>C: Verified ✓
    end

    V->>P: POST callback_url(proof_token)

    A->>P: check_application_status(app_id)
    P-->>A: status: pending_submission

    A->>P: submit_application(app_id, session_token,<br/>application_data)

    Note over P,V: Provider validates proof signature<br/>against verifier's JWKS

    P-->>A: status: submitted
    A-->>C: Application submitted ✓

    Note over A,P: No PII flows through OJCP.<br/>Agent never handles the proof.
